start

:See View Inventory;
:Navigate to Department/Category;

:Display Move Categories button;
:Click Move Categories button;
:Display Move Categories screen;

:Selects target location for moved Categories;

if(Select existing Department/Category?) then(yes)
:Use existing Department/Category;
else(no)
:Create new Category;
:Select parent Department/Category;
:Enter new Category data;
endif

switch(Select move type)
case(Move)
:Move selected categories as-is;
:Make them children of target Department/Category;
case(Merge)
:Merge contents;
:Add to target Department/Category;
endswitch

:System validates deletion;

:System moves selected Category;
:Back to parent Department/Category;

stop
